@startuml
title BeatBond - Sequence Diagram: Play and Share a Song
actor User
participant "React PWA" as UI
participant "Express API" as API
participant Clerk
participant "Saavn API" as Saavn
database MongoDB as DB
participant "Socket.IO Server" as Socket
actor Friend
User -> UI : Select song and press Play
UI -> Saavn : Request playable song/audio URL
Saavn --> UI : Song metadata and audio stream URL
UI --> User : Play audio
UI -> API : POST /api/users/listening-history
API -> Clerk : Validate session
Clerk --> API : Authenticated user
API -> DB : Save ListeningActivity
DB --> API : Activity saved
UI -> Socket : update_activity(song title)
Socket -> DB : Read user privacy/friends
alt musicPrivacy = everyone
  Socket -> Friend : activity_updated
else musicPrivacy = friends
  Socket -> Friend : activity_updated for friends only
else musicPrivacy = none
  Socket -> Socket : Do not publish activity
end
User -> UI : Like song
UI -> API : POST /api/songs/{id}/toggle-like
API -> DB : Update Song.likedBy
API --> UI : Updated liked state
@enduml
